<title>UK: GZB-Bank sets 300 million mark 10-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>GZB-Bank sets 300 million mark 10-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENOSSENSCHAFTLICHE ZENTRALBANK AG (STUTTGART)</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +12.5 BP  PAY DATE    18.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.99     FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTTGART DENOMS (K) 10	  WKN	   261 155</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   COMMON	751 2317</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
